window.products.push({"id":527098,"name":"Thornton's Reusable Plastic Ice Cube Assorted Colors 32 Icecubes for Beverage Chilling & Cooling | Fast Freezing Cubes | Keep Your Drink Cold Longer |","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Af70Qk39L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It doesn't matter what your choice of beverage is, if it needs ice, it needs Thornton's Reusable Plastic Ice Cubes. You can use them in cold brew coffees, cocktails, water, cool bags, and more. Put them in any beverage that you want chilled. You can even use them as ice packs on the go or at home. They are convenient ice cubes whenever and wherever you need them. They're especially perfect for maintaining the perfect flavor of your drinks. Ice is an essential in many drinks, but if you don't drink it fast enough it will melt and water down your drink. But that's no longer a worry with reusable ice cubes. Even as they melt, all the liquid is contained in the plastic so your beverage is just as delicious and refreshing as it was when you first made it. The fast freezing technology behind these reusable ice cubes is about to make ice makers and ice cube trays obsolete. Don't wait for hours to get a nice refreshing drink chilled to your liking when you can fast freeze these reusable cubes. Even if you just finished using them, and pop them back into the freezer for another refill. They fun and functional. You can spice up your favorite drinks with colorful ice cubes. You can make your iced coffee brighter in the morning or your summer cocktails by the pool even more beautiful. These ice cubes come in a variety of fun colors so you can mix and match to make your drink look its best. Use just your favorite color or toss in a combination of colors. The choice is yours. These ice cubes are super simple to use. You just wash and dry them. Then place in a save place in your freezer until they are the desired temperature. Pop them in your drink and enjoy! When you've finished your beverage, wash them and freeze them all over again for drink after drink. Package contains (1) Thornton's Reusable Plastic Ice Cubes Set. 32 count of ice cubes. Available in assorted colors. Washable and reusable. Made of high quality food grade plastic. Fast freezing and easy chilling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Af70Qk39L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thornton's Home Goods","source_asin":"B07GG62GMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-527098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GG62GMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GG62GMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
