window.products.push({"id":527346,"name":"vancasso Enameled Cast Iron Dutch Oven, 3.5QT Small Dutch Oven Pot with Lid, Round Enamel Dutch Oven for Bread Baking, Non Stick Enamel Coating, Pot's","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D1CQduf6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【One Pot for Multiple Use - Suitable for Families of 1-3 People】 -This 3.5-Quart vancasso enameled cast iron dutch oven is great for beginners or pros. It is resistant to acidic and alkaline substances, and you can use it to marinate food before cooking (prepare, cook, and serve food in the same pot). Safe for braising, simmering, baking, broiling, and roasting on gas, electric, ceramic, glass top, and induction stoves (not including microwave ovens); oven safe to 500°F. 【9 LBS Real Cast Iron】 -vancasso cast iron dutch oven pot's body is made of high-purity ore; the body of the dutch oven has a uniform thickness, even heat distribution, and even the taste of the food cooked. Even after leaving the heating source, it can keep warm for a long time, so you don't have to worry about the food getting cold while waiting for your family and friends to arrive. When you take the dutch oven, always use oven mitts or pot holders; the handles will be HOT! 【Historic Enamel】 -Enamel used to be more precious than gold and was later used in the firing of the porcelain, which became the exclusive of the royal family. It was not until the 20th century that the French invented the enameled cast iron pot by combining iron and enamel techniques. The vancasso dutch oven uses a non-stick safety enamel coating, no cadmium or lead, and is non-toxic and harmless even at high temperatures. Easy to clean and will never fade. 【Internal Circulation Shower Design】 -The 40 evenly distributed dots on the lid accelerate the condensation of evaporated water vapor in the food and drip it evenly into the food. In contrast, other water vapor flows smoothly back into the dutch oven because of the specific curvature design. The water vapor circulates and locks inside the dutch oven, fully releasing the flavor and nutrients of the ingredients. 【Superior Quality With vancasso】 We are here to offer you only the best quality products designed to make your life easier. If you need any help, please feel free to contact us. Our unparalleled 24/7 live customer support is ready and waiting to assist with anything you need!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D1CQduf6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"vancasso","source_asin":"B09JWR7QRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-527346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JWR7QRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JWR7QRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
