window.products.push({"id":527455,"name":"Amazon Brand – Pinzon Microfiber Sheet Set, Twin with 2 Pillowcases, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nyMqn61hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description An Amazon Brand. Amazon.com Microfiber sheet set with pillowcases offers the best of both durable strength and serious softness. view larger Microfiber Sheet Set with Pillowcases What You Need to Know: 100% polyester extra-fine weave 120 GSM microfiber 100% polyester extra-fine weave 120 GSM microfiber Set includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 4 pillowcases (Twin includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases) Set includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 4 pillowcases (Twin includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases) Breathable and comfortable for year-round use; wrinkle resistant Breathable and comfortable for year-round use; wrinkle resistant Available in a variety of colors Available in a variety of colors Machine washable Machine washable Variety of soft, muted colors available, including Ivory, Taupe, Blue Dusk, Sage Green, and Dove Gray. view larger Pinzon Microfiber Sheet Set with Pillowcases Soft Microfiber Blend A brilliant blend of strength and supple softness, this Pinzon microfiber sheet set makes a lovely and long-lasting choice when it comes to quality bedding. Made of 100% polyester 120 GSM microfiber, the sheet set features an extra-fine weave for an alluring fabric that's resilient, soothing to the skin, and breathable--perfect for year-round use. The sheet set hangs with an elegant drape and works well as a starter set for a kid's dorm room, an everyday set for at home, or even a spare set for a guest room when you want to make out-of-towners feel welcome. Variety of Sizes and Colors The microfiber sheet set comes in five sizes: Twin, Full, Queen, King, and California King. Each sheet set includes a fitted sheet, a flat sheet, and four pillowcases, except for the Twin sheet set, which comes with two pillowcases instead of four. The fitted sheet provides stretchy elastic all the way around to ensure a snug fit on the mattress, while the extra pillow cases allow for extra pillows, which come in handy for everything from decorative daytime appeal to extra support when reading in bed. The microfiber sheet set offers a range of soft, muted colors including Ivory, Taupe, Blue Dusk, Sage Green, and Dove Gray. Each graceful color resists fading and will blend beautifully with existing solid or patterned comforters, throw pillows, and surrounding bedroom decor. Machine Washable For easy cleaning and care, the microfiber sheet set is machine-washable and can go in the dryer--or be hung out on the clothesline to dry on a warm sunny day. It dries faster than cotton or blend sheets and is wrinkle-resistant. The sheet set should not be ironed. Pinzon Bedding A few simple upgrades in the bedroom can create the welcome effect of a new beginning--whether it's January 1st or a Sunday. Such a simple pleasure, really--fresh, clean sheets, fluffy pillows, and cozy comforters. You can feel like a five-star guest in your own home with bed linens by Pinzon. Fold back the covers, slip into sweet happy dreams, and wake up refreshed. It's a brand-new day. For the master bedroom or a charming guest room, the Pinzon brand provides the high-quality bedding needed for a restful night of sleep. The Pinzon brand includes everything from memory foam mattress pads, mattress and pillow protectors, sheets, and duvet sets to luxurious Permaloft pillows, which you can never have enough of--especially when enjoying breakfast in bed (sometimes you just have to indulge). About Pinzon Invite Amazon.com's Pinzon products into your home for their form and function, and experience their style, craftsmanship, and value. We travel the world to find the best materials and designs for Pinzon products and use the most sensible manufacturing methods. We thoroughly test each Pinzon item and rely on feedback from our customers to help us deliver the highest quality. Check out all of our Pinzon products, including bedding, towels, and more, and you'll find something for all occasions at the best values. With a selection that continues to grow, the Pinzon brand is set to become a part of your lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nyMqn61hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B00I3CSKVI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-527455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I3CSKVI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I3CSKVI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
