window.products.push({"id":527597,"name":"Caso Design VC.350 Vacuum Sealer All-in-One System with Food Management App, Stainless","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PCMtY3chL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Caso Design specializes in unique, innovative products that exceed expectations with German design and engineering. The casino VC 350 food Vacuum sealer All-in-One system features an adjustable vacuum level for delicate foods, a selectable sealing time for either wet or dry foods, Plus an integrated fold-out cutter for faster processing. It includes one 8-inch film roll, one 11-inch film roll, a roll box, A food Vacuum hose, and a food management app with labeling system. Vacuum sealing foods prolongs shelf life while preserving food’s freshness, flavor and nutrients. The best way to store and organize your food, It keeps food fresh up to five times longer than standard storage methods! Use for meat, fish, vegetables, hard cheese, dry goods, and more! Eliminate food waste and save money by embracing a more sustainable way to manage your food. Perfect for sous vide cooking, pair this food Vacuum sealer with our sous vide cooking stick (sold separately) to cook healthier, juicier, tastier meals. The Caso VC. 350 Vacuum Sealer helps keep food fresh longer. The system removes air (one of the main causes of freezer burn, mold, and food spoilage) from bags and creates an airtight seal to lock in freshness. The Caso VC. 350 Vacuum Sealing System comes complete with a vacuum hose for food containers and 2 professional quality starter rolls (one 8” and one 11”). With the Caso VC. 350 Vacuum Sealer, you’ll be on your way to keeping food fresh, eliminating waste, & saving money. Key Features: Caso food management app allows you to keep an inventory of your foods by labeling and sorting them by place of storage, type of food, and date. Vacuum sealing removes air, one of the main causes of freezer burn, mold, and spoilage. Two extra-wide 12” sealing bars apply heat for an airtight seal and the vacuum chamber reduces bag waste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PCMtY3chL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caso Design","source_asin":"B08123QBH3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-527597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08123QBH3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08123QBH3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":527598,"name":"Paddywax Wanderlust 7-Ounce Filled Tin Candle, New York Amber and Patchouli","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WClvm7yfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Travel Often—it’s a simple statement that sums up the very human need for escape, experience, and the excitement of disembarking at new and novel latitudes. The phrase emblazons our Wanderlust collection: four transportive scents in smoky charcoal glass and well-traveled tin boxes designed to be a perfect reminder of both journeys past and those not yet endeavored. Wanderlust is created by Paddywax, an artisan candle company known for its innovative fragrances and fresh style. All of our Candles are proudly made in the U.S.A., and every candle is hand treated from start to finish, giving each piece a personal touch. Paddywax boasts a variety of candle collections satisfying any candle need from décor to gifting to simply indulging - and isn’t that what candles are really about? The process of making Paddywax candles is artisan in every sense, closely resembling techniques used to make candles hundreds of years ago. From fragrance throw to burn time, each custom recipe is made to deliver the best experience. Our fragrance blends are developed to distribute the most natural aroma through the use of all natural ingredients. We take pride in never offering a synthetic fragrance; instead we constantly push ourselves to create something natural and unique. It begins when every candle is hand poured and ends when each product is packaged with precision. Each bow and label are applied by hand to give every product that human touch that is worthy of gift giving. We take pride in our work and know that every detail counts. Here at Paddywax we believe what is truly beautiful in life lies in the details and that is why we love what we do so much. We hope you too fall in love with Paddywax.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WClvm7yfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paddywax","source_asin":"B0079NZVW8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-527598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0079NZVW8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0079NZVW8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
