window.products.push({"id":527635,"name":"Butane Torch,Culinary Butane Lighter with Safety Lock,Refillable Torch Lighter with Adjustable Flame for Desserts,BBQ Baking, Creme Brulee Torch kits ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NsrUa0V4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Wesage is specialized in all kind of kitchen tools and home gadgets.We are committed to producing higher quality torch at more affordable price and 24-month Warranty. Please be assured that we’ll always stand behind our products. The Culinary Torch is not just the kitchen torch for making cooking easier ,Also can be used in multiple ways; Such as caramelizing sugar atop creme brulee, glazing a baked ham, searing a steak, roasting bell peppers, melting cheese and toasting bread crumbs. Also useful as butane lighters for lighting your fireplace, candles or cigars, for hobby, arts and crafts projects, jewelry making, welding,for multiple camping applications, dabs, and much more. Butane Torch Feature: - Automatic ignition - No additional tools needed for igniting - Adjustable flame control lever allows user to increase/decrease flame size - Ergonomic grip is easy to use and hold - Non tip wide base for safety - Butane powered torch is refillable - Piezo electronic ignition system for reliable ignition every time Torch Specification: Size: 4.3 x 6.1 x 2.37 inch Weight: 9.6oz(0.4LB) Flametemperature: 1300℃/2500°F Burning time: 30mins Package list : 1 X Kitchen Blow Torches(Fuel Not Included), 1 x User manual, two nozzles  Package Size : 4.8 x 6.5 x2.55 inch How to use the red tool to Refillable Torch The red plastic tool with two nozzles is for depressurizing the torch before refilling. It works like a screwdriver but won't scratch the torch. Depressurizing the torch It's important to depressurize the torch first before refilling. Simply push the refill valve with the tool and hold for about 10 seconds to purge the air out. Refilling the butane fuel lighter Torch Turn the torch upside down and refill with butane gas. After butane for lighters refill,Please leave the torch for 5 minutes before using it again","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NsrUa0V4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nobranded","source_asin":"B087TLSVLV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-527635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087TLSVLV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087TLSVLV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
