window.products.push({"id":527680,"name":"CHICON Burlap Table Runner with Lace - Farmhouse Table Runner - Natural Jute Runner - Thanksgiving Table Decorations - Rustic Wedding Decorations - 13","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vwTGP5R-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Imported from Turkey 💖%100 JUTE- MADE IN TURKEY. Size: 13” width x 48” inches long. Our product is made of %100 organic jute and premium lace. Well made rustic burlap table runner is ready to match to your farmhouse decor and the lace edging is quite attractive. You will be definitely satisfied by adding this unique rustic look to your dinner table and your farmhouse kitchen decor . 💖BEAUTY OF THE BURLAP : Burlap is a woven fabric made from natural materials. The most common source is the jute plant. There are countless uses for burlap (hessian, jute) in the home and specially Jute is excellent for crafts and decorative applications. This attractive rustic table runner will give your farmhouse kitchen table a new lease of life. 💖PREMIUM & DURABLE: Fine workmanship. Durable and eco-friendly. Not easily loose thread and made to the highest standards using tighter weave jute hessian fabric. Jute fabric has been cleaned as a final procedure and you will not see any wood fibers in the fabric . In addition to we ventilate our jute burlap table runners before shipping to you thus the burlap runner smell reduces significantly and you will get it rolled as pictured. 💖VINTAGE DESIGN: Lovely decoration for your home kitchen decor . Will definitely get the eyes on it as it’s a nice vintage jute fabric with lace around.It will give a shabby chic design to your place and will be a beautiful presentation to your guests. Washing Instructions:Spot clean or hand wash your burlap runner in cold water with mild detergent.Do not machine wash. Dry with a towel, do not twist, wring, squeeze or tumble dry. The garment steamer can be used to get wrinkles away, not iron. 💖VERSATILE - You can use burlap table runners as an everyday decor or a thanksgiving runner . Also it is perfect for different events and occasions: halloween , christmas , easter , thanksgiving , baby shower , country themed wedding , reception . In addition to burlap runners for tables will be a nice addition for a birthday party , vintage or rustic style table decors, spring and fall decorations . Also its good for displaying on banquet , candy buffet , coffee table or dining table .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vwTGP5R-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NERENZA","source_asin":"B085QKHCM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-527680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085QKHCM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085QKHCM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
