window.products.push({"id":527764,"name":"HOMBYS Water-Resistant Cover for Papasan Cushion, Quilted Zippered Slipcover Only, Removable and Machine Washable Chair Cushion Covers- 55 Inch (Fit 5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gYjVJmzyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Water-resistant & Easy Clean】Water-resistant-if your water or drink comes into contact with the cushion cover, you can wipe it off without water leaking into the inner layer. With long side zipper, it's easy to put on and remove the cover from the cushion; If you're tired of cleaning the huge cushion, get a cushion cover will save you from unpleasant chore 【Extend Cushion Life】Papasan chairs are very comfortable and often serve as sofas, but over time, the cushion upholstery gets dirty and tears easily if you use it nakedly, buying a replacement is costly and washing it is difficult, so the most common way to extend the cushion's life is to buy a cushion cover 【A Layer of Comfort】8 adjustable ties to secure your cushion cover. The chair cushion cover for papasan is quilted to maxmize the level of user comfort and perfectly keeps the shape and does not allow the filler to stray in one place; Crafted from high-quality microfiber fabric, which is soft, durable and wrinkle-free 【Why You Need】Providing your chair a layer of protection from stains, pet hairs and scratch, kids drawing; Freshing your old-fashioned chair with a new look in a cheaper way; Preventing your precious sofa from being burnt and fading outdoors 【Measurement】This covers come in two sizes. 50 Inches version (Fits a 44-48 Inch Papasan Cushion) - 55 Inches version (Fits a 50-55 Inch Papasan Cushion), it's great to freshen your old papasan chair up","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gYjVJmzyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMBYS","source_asin":"B0BJD12BN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-527764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJD12BN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJD12BN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
