window.products.push({"id":527766,"name":"DegGod 3 Pack 12X108 Inches Natural Burlap Lace Hessian Table Runner Vintage Jute Rustic Tablecloth for Country Wedding Baby Shower Party Kitchen Dini","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kEOst+PXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pack list: 3 x Burlap lace table runner(12\" width x 108\" length) Washing & Care Instruction: 1. Do not machine wash 2. Spot clean or dry clean with mild detergent 3. Hanging dry, do not twist, wring, squeeze or tumble dry 4. The steam iron can be used to get wrinkles away. 5. Please understand it is made of burlap, so it would be a little smell. Please Note: 1. One simple method of cleaning your burlap fabric is to simply shake them and hang them outside. 2. The sunlight might bleach away lighter stains and odors can air out. Don't leave the burlap out in wet conditions, including fog. 3. If two or three days time in the sun doesn't remove enough of the odor, sprinkle baking soda all over the burlap and leave the powder in place for at least a day to absorb the smell. How to maintain the table runner? (Shipment fold flat, wrinkles exist.) 1. Spray the table runner with a spray bottle filled with water until it is quite damp. 2. Set it flat onto an ironing board and cover the largest wrinkles with a thin towel. 3. Set your iron to its lowest heat setting and allow it several minutes to heat up. 4. Gently press the iron atop the towel to release the table runner's worst wrinkles. 5. Hand rolled and Individually packaged in order to eliminate folds and creases.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kEOst+PXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DegGod","source_asin":"B094J822KN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-527766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094J822KN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094J822KN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
