window.products.push({"id":527805,"name":"Yaheetech 52in Ottoman Bench Folding Storage Ottoman Bench Tufted Fabric Entryway Bench with Arms Footstool with Large Storage Foot Rest Seat Rolled A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KxA88a+cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍【Simple & Versatile design】A perfect combination of fabric and pine wood deliver a sense of warmness and soothing vibe to your place. Rolled armrests look vintage and elegant, along with classic color, this tufted storage bench is compatible with most decoration style. 👍【Hidden Compartment Storage】A roomy interior is hidden under the top of the bench to keep your items. It is ideal for limited living space with the interior storage space measuring 99.6 × 37 × 14.5 cm/ 39.2 × 14.6 × 5.7’’ (L × W × H) which can be used to keep seasonal blankets, pillows, throws, books, and magazines. 👍【Sturdy & Stable】Constructed with sturdy composition boards and P2 MDF board, supported by solid pinewood legs, this storage bench can hold up to 300kg/661lb in total. Slanted pinewood legs make this fabric tufted storage bench firm and stable to use. 👍【Universal Ottoman Bench】This tufted storage bench can be used as a bench for the entryway where you can sit down and take off your shoes, it also can be soft to touch ottoman in the living room to enjoy each moment at home. Besides, the tufted storage bench can be placed at the waiting area of a shop for guests and customers to sit when needed. 👍【Easy to Assemble】All the necessary hardware and handy tools are provided in the package including a well-illustrated instruction manual. It requires fewer steps to assemble this storage bench. For your safety, please do not stand inside the compartment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KxA88a+cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yaheetech","source_asin":"B0BVYK6DGJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-527805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVYK6DGJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVYK6DGJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
