window.products.push({"id":527981,"name":"Oneida Sunnybrook 53-Piece Flatware Set, Service for 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3125R84JCGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Your style is simple yet unique, which makes this Oneida Sunnybrook flatware set perfect for your table. Each piece features a banded pattern that widens towards the handle base, creating the look of an architectural column. Set includes eight 5-pc. settings with place forks, salad forks, place/soup spoons, teaspoons and butter knives; 5 serving pieces and 8 extra teaspoons. Utensils are crafted of 18/10 stainless steel, with 18% chromium for strength and 10% nickel for superb luster. Dishwasher safe. Imported. Amazon.com Sunnybrook flatware from Oneida is an ideal combination of flair and simplicity, making it perfect for everyday use or more festive meals. The pattern features a straight-sided handle with a slight flare. Understated horizontal lines at the base and shank catch the light and add depth to the design. The working ends are strikingly elongated with a smart but subtle scoop design. Crafted from stainless steel with 18 percent chrome, the pattern is highly tarnish-resistant and has a pleasant medium weight. With 53 pieces in all, this set features place settings for eight, each with a 7-1/8-inch salad fork, an 8-1/8-inch place fork, a 9-inch place knife, a 7-1/4-inch soupspoon, and a 6-3/8-inch teaspoon. The five-piece service set includes two serving spoons, a serving fork, a butter knife, and a sugar spoon. Eight extra teaspoons are also included, so you don't have to wash up to serve coffee or tea. Safe in the dishwasher, the pattern carries a 25-year warranty. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box 8 place settings, 5 serving pieces. Each place setting consists of: salad fork; dinner fork; knife; soupspoon; 2 teaspoons. Service set consists of: 2 serving spoons; serving fork; butter knife; sugar spoon. 53 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3125R84JCGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oneida","source_asin":"B0000CF8JX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-527981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CF8JX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CF8JX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
