window.products.push({"id":527988,"name":"JONYJ Shower Caddy, 2-Pack Adhesive Shower Organizer with 2 Soap Dishes and 16 Hooks,Shower Shelf for Bedroom, Living Room, Bathroom, Kitchen, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vqVJWmhTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100%iron 🌟【WATERPROOF & RUSTPROOF】Since the bathroom is usually the most humid room in the house, you’ll want to choose a shower organizer that can stand up to the steamy conditions. Shower caddies sleek black frame is made with Iron baking varnish that’s still lightweight, and strong enough to handle years of use.It prevents rust and corrosion. The hollow design at the bottom can help drain and dry quickly, avoiding harmful substances in humid environments 🌟【LARGE CAPACITY】This is a shower shelf with multiple shelves or storage baskets--2 shower rack and 2 soap shelves. The shower shelves are sturdy and large enough to fit the entire family. Its four shelves can store items such as shower gel, shampoo and beauty accessories in an orderly manner, and its large-capacity design ensures that you have enough space to place oversized bottled products 🌟【12+4 HOOK】It is a versatile shower caddy. The design of the shower storage with 12 fixed hooks has met the needs of hanging any items. It is also intimately equipped with four removable hooks, they can be attached almost anywhere on the product, making them great for loofas, razors, and washcloths alike. It also works well as a spice rack in the kitchen or cleaning supply organizer in a utility or laundry room 🌟【SUPER LOAD-BEARING】 The strong sealant ensures the strong load-bearing and adhesion of the shower caddy. It adheres very firmly to the surface of tiles and stone, making the whole product very stable. It is more durable and firmer than the suction cup, and it is not afraid of water impact. The maximum load-bearing capacity of each adhesive pad is 40 pounds. Put your bathroom or kitchen supplies on the shower shelf and it will still be balanced without tipping over 🌟【CONVENIENT INSTALLATION】The shelf has two installation methods--punch-free & punch, so it is suitable for all walls. The shower organizer comes with installation accessories--screw set & adhesive sealant. The adhesive sealant is suitable for any existing smooth stone and tile surfaces, and can be easily installed within a few minutes. The shower shelf can be installed on any surface enough of the shower room, which is very convenient for you to install and remove","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vqVJWmhTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JONYJ","source_asin":"B0BPLB4JQF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-527988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPLB4JQF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPLB4JQF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
